{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7c1e4a9-2f58-4d33-8a10-tms-division",
    "name": "TMS — Division (WBS 2.3)",
    "description": "Division APIs on the Node process (port 3001). No UI. Extends the existing branch.division table. No sap-upsert.\n\n## Setup\n1. `npm run api:sql` then `npm run api`.\n2. Set collection variables `login` and `password`.\n3. A published Zone must already exist (run the Zone collection, submit Z-SOUTH).\n4. Run folder **0. Login + zone** first. The script saves `token` and `zoneId`.\n5. `legalEntityId` is a UUID placeholder. The Legal Entity table is not in the database yet, so any UUID is accepted. Replace it when WBS 2.1 exists.\n6. No trailing slash. Port **3001**, not 3000.\n\n## Status (AUTO)\nPOST create → **DRAFT**\nPOST submit `{ reason }` → **PUBLISHED**\nPATCH on PUBLISHED stays **PUBLISHED**\nPOST approve or reject → 409, because submit never sets PENDING\n\nCode is stored uppercase and is unique across the company (`DIV-CHE`).\nZone must be PUBLISHED. timeZone is an IANA name (`Asia/Kolkata`). country is an ISO code (`IN`).\nstandardMethod: Road | Rail | Pipeline | Marine\nreason: Correction | New record | Regulatory update | Commercial change\n\nDELETE sets `deleted_at`. A division that still has a shipping point or vehicle returns 409 HAS_CHILDREN.\nenviroment is spelled that way on purpose.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3001" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "login", "value": "your.email@company.com" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "" },
    { "key": "producttype", "value": "TMS" },
    { "key": "enviroment", "value": "DEV" },
    { "key": "zoneId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "legalEntityId", "value": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333" },
    { "key": "divisionId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "secondDivisionId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "versionNo", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Login + zone",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "00 Health",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
            "description": "No token. 200 { ok: true }."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "01 Login — get accessToken",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const token = json.accessToken || json.access_token || json.token;",
                  "  if (token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"producttype\": \"{{producttype}}\",\n  \"enviroment\": \"{{enviroment}}\",\n  \"login\": \"{{login}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jwt/login",
            "description": "Public. Saves accessToken to {{token}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02 Lookups Zone — save published parent",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const rows = pm.response.json() || [];",
                  "  const row = rows.find((r) => r.code === 'Z-SOUTH') || rows[0];",
                  "  if (row && row.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('zoneId', row.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/lookups/zones",
            "description": "Published zones only. Prefers Z-SOUTH. Saves {{zoneId}}. Create and submit a zone first if this list is empty."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Happy path",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "03 POST create",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('divisionId', json.id);",
                  "  if (json.versionNo) pm.collectionVariables.set('versionNo', String(json.versionNo));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"DIV-CHE\",\n  \"name\": \"Chennai Division\",\n  \"legalEntityId\": \"{{legalEntityId}}\",\n  \"zoneId\": \"{{zoneId}}\",\n  \"searchTerm1\": \"CHENNAI\",\n  \"street\": \"Plot 12, Industrial Estate\",\n  \"postalCode\": \"600001\",\n  \"city\": \"Chennai\",\n  \"country\": \"IN\",\n  \"region\": \"Tamil Nadu\",\n  \"timeZone\": \"Asia/Kolkata\",\n  \"language\": \"EN\",\n  \"telephone\": \"+91 44 4000 1000\",\n  \"email\": \"chennai.ops@timescan.in\",\n  \"standardMethod\": \"Road\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"New record\",\n  \"changeNote\": \"Postman create\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions",
            "description": "201 { id, status: DRAFT, versionNo: 1 }. Saves {{divisionId}}. Run request 02 first. A second run returns 409 because DIV-CHE already exists. A draft zone returns 400 PARENT_NOT_PUBLISHED."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "04 GET by id",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.versionNo) pm.collectionVariables.set('versionNo', String(json.versionNo));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions/{{divisionId}}",
            "description": "200 full division, including zoneCode and zoneName. Refreshes {{versionNo}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "05 GET list",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions?q=DIV-CHE&status=DRAFT&page=1&pageSize=20&sort=code",
            "description": "200 { items, total, page }. Soft-deleted rows are omitted."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "06 POST submit",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Publish the division\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions/{{divisionId}}/submit",
            "description": "DRAFT → PUBLISHED. 200 { status: PUBLISHED }. Empty reason → 400. versionNo becomes 2."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "07 GET lookups — published only",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/lookups/divisions",
            "description": "200 [{ id, code, name }]. DIV-CHE appears after submit. Shipping Point and Vehicle use this list."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "08 GET by id — refresh version after submit",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.versionNo) pm.collectionVariables.set('versionNo', String(json.versionNo));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions/{{divisionId}}",
            "description": "After create and submit, versionNo is 2. Run this before the published PATCH."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "09 PATCH published — stays PUBLISHED",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.versionNo) pm.collectionVariables.set('versionNo', String(json.versionNo));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"DIV-CHE\",\n  \"name\": \"Chennai Division\",\n  \"legalEntityId\": \"{{legalEntityId}}\",\n  \"zoneId\": \"{{zoneId}}\",\n  \"postalCode\": \"600001\",\n  \"city\": \"Chennai\",\n  \"country\": \"IN\",\n  \"timeZone\": \"Asia/Kolkata\",\n  \"standardMethod\": \"Road\",\n  \"comments\": \"Operating unit for southern deliveries\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"Commercial change\",\n  \"changeNote\": \"Added a comment\",\n  \"versionNo\": {{versionNo}}\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions/{{divisionId}}",
            "description": "200 { id, versionNo, status: PUBLISHED }. AUTO does not send the row back to DRAFT. Wrong versionNo → 409 STALE_VERSION. Run request 08 first."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "10 POST approve (expect 409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"note\": \"Approved\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions/{{divisionId}}/approve",
            "description": "409 Only PENDING rows can be approved. Submit already published the row. Needs mdm.master.approve."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "11 POST reject (expect 409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"note\": \"Rejected\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions/{{divisionId}}/reject",
            "description": "409 Only PENDING rows can be rejected."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "12 GET versions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions/{{divisionId}}/versions",
            "description": "200 { versions[] }."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "13 GET audit",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions/{{divisionId}}/audit",
            "description": "200 { events[] }."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Validation",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "14 GET list — no token (expect 401)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions",
            "description": "401 when Authorization is missing."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "15 POST without zoneId (expect 400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"DIV-NOZONE\",\n  \"name\": \"Missing zone\",\n  \"legalEntityId\": \"{{legalEntityId}}\",\n  \"postalCode\": \"600001\",\n  \"city\": \"Chennai\",\n  \"country\": \"IN\",\n  \"timeZone\": \"Asia/Kolkata\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"New record\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions",
            "description": "400 { code: VALIDATION, field: zoneId }."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "16 POST bad time zone (expect 400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"DIV-TZ\",\n  \"name\": \"Bad clock\",\n  \"legalEntityId\": \"{{legalEntityId}}\",\n  \"zoneId\": \"{{zoneId}}\",\n  \"postalCode\": \"600001\",\n  \"city\": \"Chennai\",\n  \"country\": \"IN\",\n  \"timeZone\": \"IST\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"New record\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions",
            "description": "400 { code: VALIDATION, field: timeZone }. IST is not an IANA name. Use Asia/Kolkata."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "17 POST unknown zone (expect 400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"DIV-GHOST\",\n  \"name\": \"Unknown zone\",\n  \"legalEntityId\": \"{{legalEntityId}}\",\n  \"zoneId\": \"44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444\",\n  \"postalCode\": \"600001\",\n  \"city\": \"Chennai\",\n  \"country\": \"IN\",\n  \"timeZone\": \"Asia/Kolkata\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"New record\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions",
            "description": "400 { code: PARENT_NOT_FOUND, field: zoneId }."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "18 POST duplicate code (expect 409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"div-che\",\n  \"name\": \"Chennai again\",\n  \"legalEntityId\": \"{{legalEntityId}}\",\n  \"zoneId\": \"{{zoneId}}\",\n  \"postalCode\": \"600001\",\n  \"city\": \"Chennai\",\n  \"country\": \"IN\",\n  \"timeZone\": \"Asia/Kolkata\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"New record\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions",
            "description": "409 { code: CONFLICT, field: code }. Codes are stored uppercase, so div-che matches DIV-CHE. Run request 03 first."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "19 POST second division",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('secondDivisionId', json.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"DIV-WEST\",\n  \"name\": \"West Division\",\n  \"legalEntityId\": \"{{legalEntityId}}\",\n  \"zoneId\": \"{{zoneId}}\",\n  \"postalCode\": \"400001\",\n  \"city\": \"Mumbai\",\n  \"country\": \"IN\",\n  \"timeZone\": \"Asia/Kolkata\",\n  \"standardMethod\": \"Rail\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"New record\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions",
            "description": "201 DRAFT. Saves {{secondDivisionId}} for the empty-reason and soft-delete requests. A second run returns 409."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "20 POST submit with empty reason (expect 400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions/{{secondDivisionId}}/submit",
            "description": "400 { code: VALIDATION, field: reason }. The row stays DRAFT. Run request 19 first."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "21 DELETE second division",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions/{{secondDivisionId}}",
            "description": "200 { id, deleted: true }. Sets deleted_at. If a shipping point or vehicle still points at this division, the same call returns 409 HAS_CHILDREN."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Import and export",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "22 GET export",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions/export",
            "description": "200 text/csv of DRAFT and PUBLISHED rows. Soft-deleted rows are omitted."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "23 POST import JSON",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "[\n  {\n    \"code\": \"DIV-EAST\",\n    \"name\": \"East Division\",\n    \"legalEntityId\": \"{{legalEntityId}}\",\n    \"zoneId\": \"{{zoneId}}\",\n    \"postalCode\": \"700001\",\n    \"city\": \"Kolkata\",\n    \"country\": \"IN\",\n    \"timeZone\": \"Asia/Kolkata\",\n    \"standardMethod\": \"Pipeline\",\n    \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n    \"reason\": \"New record\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"code\": \"DIV-CHE\",\n    \"name\": \"Chennai again\",\n    \"legalEntityId\": \"{{legalEntityId}}\",\n    \"zoneId\": \"{{zoneId}}\",\n    \"postalCode\": \"600001\",\n    \"city\": \"Chennai\",\n    \"country\": \"IN\",\n    \"timeZone\": \"Asia/Kolkata\",\n    \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n    \"reason\": \"New record\"\n  }\n]",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions/import",
            "description": "200 { accepted, rejected }. Row 1 is accepted as DRAFT. Row 2 is rejected because DIV-CHE already exists. The file is not all-or-nothing. Run requests 02 and 03 first so {{zoneId}} is a published zone."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "24 POST import Excel (expect 400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/vnd.ms-excel" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "not-a-csv",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "text" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/divisions/import",
            "description": "400 { message: CSV template mismatch }. Excel is not accepted. Send text/csv or a JSON array."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
